our work!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818480/extras/7bdf1a407792eb84e7d3a2d2b0472bc5.poster.avif?t=1738685598\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818480/extras/7bdf1a407792eb84e7d3a2d2b0472bc5.webm?t=1738685598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818480/extras/7bdf1a407792eb84e7d3a2d2b0472bc5.mp4?t=1738685598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try not to do <strong>anything illegal</strong> or lawman will catch you and put you to <strong>jail</strong> (there is nothing to do, honestly)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818480/extras/56bbc03fb0e79c3ec2dd4f9696c0a7b9.poster.avif?t=1738685598\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818480/extras/56bbc03fb0e79c3ec2dd4f9696c0a7b9.webm?t=1738685598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818480/extras/56bbc03fb0e79c3ec2dd4f9696c0a7b9.mp4?t=1738685598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earn money</strong>, buy short-time <strong>power-ups</strong> or save up for  more valuable <strong>upgrades</strong> in the shop that will less your struggles! (Or buy your teammate out from the jail)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take care of yourself - <strong>watch out for the dirt</strong> so you won't damage customers' orders</p>